Z||000033||Archie||12-22-2001||06:12 PM||||Boy you guys from Fieros West sure have a hard time communicating without using the foul language don't you?<P>If you'll re-read the thread, you'll find that my comment "Now, that'll be a short meeting." was made before your little group at Fieros West decided to do some Archie bashing. Anthony, you as President of Fieros West and these other members are doing a pretty good job of proving that there aren't any real deep thinkers at Fieros West.<P>It's kind of funny that all you name callers and stone throwers come from the same little group in the same little Club.<P>Like a bunch of High School kids, you all seem to like making fun of someone elses' name. Imagine the fun someone could have making fun of Anthony Sisneros.<P>You ramble on about something "car capital of the world... yadda yadda yadda" It's hard to figure out what you were trying to say. I'd recommend that you check with your local Journalism Major and see if he can help you write a couple of paragraphs that someone can understand.<P>Now, I guess it's your turn to call me some more names and show what a bunch of (fill in the blank)s you have there in your Club.<P>Archie<P>BTW, Anthony Sisneros, this is the last time you'll be allowed to call me that many names without me doing the same to you in return. Since I'm "just too annoying to be worth anymore of my (your) time.", We are certainly happy that you took the time to call me an *******  6 times. <P>Eric's statements making fun of someone elses' name were unprovoked and very rude. Your Nasty mouth, calling people names, reflects very poorly upon you and your group. <P>Your Club, your Region & your State should be very proud of the way you guys handled yourselves, so professionally in this thread.<P>ejayerik, "California Fiero meeting of the minds????" I don't think so..... not if Fieros West has anything to say about it.<P>STUK'N'80s: Who baited who? Read the 1st 4 posts again.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000034||WKDFIRO||12-22-2001||07:13 PM||||Actually, I think it was time well spent.<P>I would never take anything you say or do very seriously much less as a reflection of any club in Illinois. No, this is all about you.<P>I do apologize if you didn't understand everything I was trying to convey and there would have been many more asterixs (asterexi?) had I actually called you that name six times.  <P>Though I cannot help but be touched that you did take the time to count.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>As for being accused of not being a deep thinker, well, I'll just have to learn how to live with your disappointment.  <P>One hilarious, sunny California day at a time. <P>Merry Christmas to all. ||||reg||6
